      "body": "<h2>Spectacle and danger</h2><p>The arena’s entertainment includes lethal violence. Vaerik enters alone and defeats two enormous apes while Vespere encourages him from the audience.</p><h2>Victory and its consequences</h2><p>The crowd recognises the stranger’s achievement, and the Arena Master expresses astonishment. No championship or house recruitment is completed in this scene. Chayma reports a refused payout on her winning wager; the dispute remains open.</p>",
