      "body": "<h2>The way to the refuge</h2><p>The rescued kobolds guide the company through winding natural and worked passages with traps. Their route leads to tents inside an older, larger structure whose origins are not established.</p><h2>Hospitality after the rescue</h2><p>The refuge welcomes the company with a mushroom-heavy banquet. Its existence and the rescue are witnessed; the wider war and the fate of the overlord remain unresolved.</p>",
