      "body": "<h2>Rescue and loss</h2><p>Vespere heals, Sombra fights and provides food, and Keagan is helped after falling from blood loss. Chayma survives; her sister cannot be restored with ordinary healing.</p><h2>Entering the city</h2><p>Eudora asks that the body come with them, and Sombra carries it. Chayma directs the company to entry dinars and later offers lodging in gratitude. Her sister is named Saffiah in a subsequent conversation.</p>",
