      "body": "<h2>The attack</h2><p>Cart barriers and apparent flames obstruct the street. Attackers threaten Chayma and seek valuables; Nazif guards push through the flames, revealing them as illusions.</p><h2>Aftermath</h2><p>Ibin Ali provides restitution in dinars. Threats made against the captured attackers are not recorded here as completed executions. The attackers’ full sponsors and motives remain unproven.</p>",
