      "body": "<h2>Below the streets</h2><p>The exploration begins on 18 June with mechanisms and entrances below the deserted quarter. The next session reveals a deep shaft, hazards, earth-like enemies and a furnished cavern guarded by armed occupants.</p><h2>Negotiation</h2><p>Xuan negotiates while Vaerik threatens. A brass scorpion pin is provided for contact in Peddlers Passage, then passed to Vaerik.</p><h2>Limits of the discovery</h2><p>The party suspects an elemental connection, but the account does not confirm the tunnels’ ultimate origin. The pin is not proof of membership in House Tayyeb.</p>",
