      "body": "<h2>Returning with help</h2><p>Sombra ferries companions as a giant owl. Catalina and Kaia help locate possible approaches, and tracks lead to a narrow entrance.</p><h2>The rescue</h2><p>The company encounters dragonkin escorting four chained kobolds. A leader invokes the name Runaldas, but that person does not appear. After the escort is defeated, Kaia breaks the chain.</p><h2>A refuge, not a final victory</h2><p>The freed prisoners lead the company through winding passages to Icyscale Roost, a tent settlement within an older structure. A banquet follows. The scene establishes a rescue and refuge, not the fall of the overlord.</p>",
